DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260531T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260531T160000
SUMMARY:Tichu tournament - competitive level
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nHi all\,\n\nSo were doing a Tic
 hu tournament. The event date is May 31st starting at noon. The format wil
 l be Swiss style.\n\nWe will just play the Swiss rounds and declare a winn
 er (and second) and award prizes from there. I'm limiting it to 16 teams\,
  but we have not come close to that yet.\n\nI will be playing in this one.
  I'll still be the rules lawyer for the day\, but I'll designate someone n
 ot affiliated to be the back up rules person in case a ruling is needed at
  a table I'm participating in.\n\nReach out if you have any questions.\n\n
 **Registration link:**\n[https://www.gamersgeekery.com/events#!event/2026/
 5/31/tichu-tournament](https://www.gamersgeekery.com/events#!event/2026/5/
 31/tichu-tournament)\n\nHope to see you there\,\nLance
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 314089454/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260402T150253Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260402T150253Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
